  "about": "One skill, declared as data (trigger, steps, checks, stop). Each task names the page it runs on and what the run must report: which skill claimed it (null on the controls), whether a check stopped it, and how many points the composed answer actually delivers. A check that runs after a step cannot unrun it, so the delivered count is what makes padding visible.",
  "tasks": [
